arner encounters this situation: a protagonist's choices contribute to a devastating outcome. Which concept best matches it?", "options": [ "Screenplay", "Antagonist", "Tragedy", "Protagonist" ], "answer": 2, "explanation": "The correct answer is Tragedy. It matches the defining characteristic or role described in the question.", "tags": [ "drama" ], "status": "active" }, { "id": "DRAMA-EASY-001-4", "category": "Drama", "subcategory": "Drama", "difficulty": "easy", "question": "Which option best identifies the primary purpose or role associated with Tragedy?", "options": [ "reinforce themes", "explore serious conflict and human consequences", "anchor the narrative", "encourage audiences to continue" ], "answer": 1, "explanation": "The correct answer is explore serious conflict and human consequences. It matches the defining characteristic or role described in the question.", "tags": [ "drama" ], "status": "active" }, { "id": "DRAMA-EASY-002-1", "category": "Drama", "subcategory": "Drama", "difficulty": "easy", "question": "Which term is best described by the following definition: a drama emphasizing heightened emotion and clear emotional conflicts?", "options": [ "Antagonist", "Melodrama", "Dialogue", "Flashback" ], "answer": 1, "explanation": "The correct answer is Melodrama. It matches the defining characteristic or role described in the question.", "tags": [ "drama" ], "status": "active" }, { "id": "DRAMA-MEDIUM-002-2", "category": "Drama", "subcategory": "Drama", "difficulty": "medium", "question": "Which statement best describes Melodrama?", "options": [ "a drama emphasizing heightened emotion and clear emotional conflicts", "the time and place in which a story occurs", "an ending that leaves a major situation unresolved", "a struggle between opposing forces, goals, or values" ], "answer": 0, "explanation": "The correct answer is a drama emphasizing heightened emotion and clear emotional conflicts. It matches the defining characteristic or role described in the question.", "tags": [ "drama" ], "status": "active" }, { "id": "DRAMA-HARD-002-3", "category": "Drama", "subcategory": "Drama", "difficulty": "hard", "question": "A learner encounters this situation: characters face strongly emotional situations with pronounced moral tension. Which concept best matches it?", "options": [ "Dialogue", "Improvisation", "Adaptation", "Melodrama" ], "answer": 3, "explanation": "The correct answer is Melodrama. It matches the defining characteristic or role described in the question.", "tags": [ "drama" ], "status": "active" }, { "id": "DRAMA-MEDIUM-002-4", "category": "Drama", "subcategory": "Drama", "difficulty": "medium", "question": "Which option best identifies the primary purpose or role associated with Melodrama?", "options": [ "intensify emotional storytelling", "guide performance and staging", "create conflict", "reinterpret an existing story" ], "answer": 0, "explanation": "The correct answer is intensify emotional storytelling. It matches the defining characteristic or role described in the question.", "tags": [ "drama" ], "status": "active" }, { "id": "DRAMA-EASY-003-1", "category": "Drama", "subcategory": "Drama", "difficulty": "easy", "question": "Which term is best described by the following definition: the meaningful development or change of a character over a story?", "options": [ "Tragedy", "Character arc", "Theme", "Motif" ], "answer": 1, "explanation": "The correct answer is Character arc. It matches the defining characteristic or role described in the question.", "tags": [ "drama" ], "status": "active" }, { "id": "DRAMA-MEDIUM-003-2", "category": "Drama", "subcategory": "Drama", "difficulty": "medium", "question": "Which statement best describes Character arc?", "options": [ "the meaningful development or change of a character over a story", "a character or force that opposes the protagonist", "the part of a story in which major conflicts are concluded or settled", "a drama emphasizing heightened emotion and clear emotional conflicts" ], "answer": 0, "explanation": "The correct answer is the meaningful development or change of a character over a story. It matches the defining characteristic or role described in the question.", "tags": [ "drama" ], "status": "active" }, { "id": "DRAMA-HARD-003-3", "category": "Drama", "subcategory": "Drama", "difficulty": "hard", "question": "A learner encounters this situation: a protagonist begins with one worldview and ends with another. Which concept best matches it?", "options": [ "Conflict", "Character arc", "Foreshadowing", "Climax" ], "answer": 1, "explanation": "The correct answer is Character arc. It matches the defining characteristic or role described in the question.", "tags": [ "drama" ], "status": "active" }, { "id": "DRAMA-HARD-003-4", "category": "Drama", "subcategory": "Drama", "difficulty": "hard", "question": "Which option best identifies the primary purpose or role associated with Character arc?", "options": [ "encourage audiences to continue", "show character transformation", "provide a high point of tension", "control dramatic rhythm" ], "answer": 1, "explanation": "The correct answer is show character transformation. It matches the defining characteristic or role described in the question.", "tags": [ "drama" ], "status": "active" }, { "id": "DRAMA-EASY-004-1", "category": "Drama", "subcategory": "Drama", "difficulty": "easy", "question": "Which term is best described by the following definition: the principal character whose goals drive the story?", "options": [ "Setting", "Motif", "Protagonist", "Cliffhanger" ], "answer": 2, "explanation": "The correct answer is Protagonist. It matches the defining characteristic or role described in the question.", "tags": [ "drama" ], "status": "active" }, { "id": "DRAMA-MEDIUM-004-2", "category": "Drama", "subcategory": "Drama", "difficulty": "medium", "question": "Which statement best describes Protagonist?", "options": [ "a drama emphasizing heightened emotion and clear emotional c