osion?", "options": [ "understand material degradation", "analyze energy conversion", "relate pressure, speed, and elevation", "transfer heat between fluid streams" ], "answer": 0, "explanation": "The correct answer is understand material degradation. It matches the defining characteristic or role described in the question.", "tags": [ "engineering" ], "status": "active" }, { "id": "ENGINEERING-EASY-025-1", "category": "Engineering", "subcategory": "Engineering", "difficulty": "easy", "question": "Which term is best described by the following definition: failure or damage caused by repeated or fluctuating stresses?", "options": [ "Strain", "CNC", "CAD", "Fatigue" ], "answer": 3, "explanation": "The correct answer is Fatigue. It matches the defining characteristic or role described in the question.", "tags": [ "engineering" ], "status": "active" }, { "id": "ENGINEERING-MEDIUM-025-2", "category": "Engineering", "subcategory": "Engineering", "difficulty": "medium", "question": "Which statement best describes Fatigue?", "options": [ "a device that transfers thermal energy between fluids without necessarily mixing them", "a numerical technique that divides a complex domain into smaller elements for analysis", "a force acting parallel to a cross-section", "failure or damage caused by repeated or fluctuating stresses" ], "answer": 3, "explanation": "The correct answer is failure or damage caused by repeated or fluctuating stresses. It matches the defining characteristic or role described in the question.", "tags": [ "engineering" ], "status": "active" }, { "id": "ENGINEERING-HARD-025-3", "category": "Engineering", "subcategory": "Engineering", "difficulty": "hard", "question": "A learner encounters this situation: a component fails after many load cycles even though each load is below static strength. Which concept best matches it?", "options": [ "Forging", "Fatigue", "Casting", "Shear force" ], "answer": 1, "explanation": "The correct answer is Fatigue. It matches the def