ode", "variable air volume, a system that varies supply airflow to zones", "a control sequence that removes accumulated frost from an outdoor heat-pump coil", "temperature of liquid below its saturation temperature at a given pressure" ], "answer": 0, "explanation": "The correct answer is a system that can transfer heat in either direction depending on operating mode. It matches the defining characteristic or role described in the question.", "tags": [ "hvac" ], "status": "active" }, { "id": "HVAC-HARD-020-3", "category": "HVAC", "subcategory": "HVAC", "difficulty": "hard", "question": "A learner encounters this situation: the same system can provide heating in winter and cooling in summer. Which concept best matches it?", "options": [ "Heat pump", "Superheat", "VAV", "BTU" ], "answer": 0, "explanation": "The correct answer is Heat pump. It matches the defining characteristic or role described in the question.", "tags": [ "hvac" ], "status": "active" }, { "id": "HVAC-MEDIUM-020-4", "category": "HVAC", "subcategory": "HVAC", "difficulty": "medium", "question": "Which option best identifies the primary purpose or role associated with Heat pump?", "options": [ "assess duct-system resistance", "express cooling capacity", "describe how close air is to saturation", "move heat between indoors and outdoors" ], "answer": 3, "explanation": "The correct answer is move heat between indoors and outdoors. It matches the defining characteristic or role described in the question.", "tags": [ "hvac" ], "status": "active" }, { "id": "HVAC-EASY-021-1", "category": "HVAC", "subcategory": "HVAC", "difficulty": "easy", "question": "Which term is best described by the following definition: a control sequence that removes accumulated frost from an outdoor heat-pump coil?", "options": [ "Superheat", "Psychrometrics", "Economizer", "Defrost cycle" ], "answer": 3, "explanation": "The correct answer is Defrost cycle. It matches the defining characteristic or role described in the question.", "